sequenceDiagram
  participant Fan
  participant API
  participant Payment
  participant Ticket
  participant Chain
  participant Scanner

  Fan->>API: Select tier and buy ticket
  API->>Payment: Authorize payment
  Payment-->>API: Payment authorized
  API->>Ticket: Reserve inventory
  Ticket->>Chain: Mint ticket
  Chain-->>Ticket: Mint receipt
  Ticket-->>Fan: Ticket available in wallet
  Fan->>Scanner: Present QR/signed proof
  Scanner->>Ticket: Validate ticket
  Ticket->>Chain: Verify owner/status if needed
  Ticket-->>Scanner: Allow and mark redeemed
